cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fdtd-channel: a 1D FDTD transmission-line solver"
abstract: >-
  A from-scratch finite-difference time-domain (FDTD) solver for the
  telegrapher's equations. C++17 time-stepping cores and Python analysis
  extract the reflection coefficient, S-parameters, and frequency-dependent
  loss of a transmission line, each checked against the analytic answer.
authors:
  - family-names: "Pham"
    given-names: "Jack"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jackpham-rgb/fdtd-channel"
keywords:
  - FDTD
  - transmission line
  - telegrapher's equations
  - S-parameters
  - signal integrity
